## Contract

- Split each source into obligation-bearing units: numbered clauses/questions, form tables,
  schedules, submission instructions and unnumbered mandatory text.
- `mapped` requires one or more real Req IDs. Other dispositions require a reason.
- Every Req ID in `compliance_matrix.md` must appear in at least one mapped row.
- Every Markdown source file in the received-pack manifest must appear in at least one real row.
- Re-run this audit when an amendment or replacement source arrives.
